  "brief": {
    "en": "A driver with a rich j-pop listening history (8 tracks, strong usage/acceptance/recovery) on a fairly tired, monotonous highway drive. Three of the driver's otherwise-strongest tracks were played just minutes ago. The recency/novelty penalty pushes those three down even though the situation and taste both favor them, demonstrating that the algorithm avoids immediately repeating songs — a different track (still j-pop-adjacent) wins instead.",
    "ja": "豊富なJ-POP視聴履歴（8曲、高い利用実績・受諾率・回復率）を持つドライバーが、やや疲労した単調な高速走行中。本来最も強いはずの3曲を数分前に再生済み。状況も嗜好もその3曲を支持するにもかかわらず、新鮮さ（直近再生）ペナルティにより順位が下がる — 同じ曲の連続再生を避ける挙動を示し、別の曲（J-POP系統ではある）が代わりに勝つ。"
  },
